    {
     "q": "Los gelyktydig op vir $x$ en $y$: $y=x+1$ en $x^2+y^2=25$.",
     "marks": 6,
     "solution": [
      "Vervang $y=x+1$ in $x^2+y^2=25$: $x^2+(x+1)^2=25$",
      "$x^2+x^2+2x+1=25$",
      "$2x^2+2x-24=0$, dus $x^2+x-12=0$",
      "$(x+4)(x-3)=0$",
      "$x=-4$ of $x=3$",
      "As $x=-4$ dan is $y=-3$; as $x=3$ dan is $y=4$"
     ],
     "answer": "$(x;y)=(-4;-3)$ of $(x;y)=(3;4)$"
    }
   ]
  },
