      "$x^2-3x-4=0$",
      "$(x-4)(x+1)=0$, dus $x=4$ of $x=-1$",
      "Kontroleer $x=-1$: LK $=\\sqrt{4}=2$ maar RK $=-2$, dus is $x=-1$ ongeldig",
      "Slegs $x=4$"
     ],
     "answer": "$x=4$ (die oplossing $x=-1$ is ongeldig)"
    }
   ]
